er capabilities, priority formula, and simulation of review capacity. Investigator feedback and audit history, including decision tracking and retraining workflow, are also accounted for. Visual direction specifications are documented, including the color palette for a consistent interface.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path \"C:\\Users\\S Nandhakumar\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\fraudlens-ai\" -Force","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolSummary":"Create project directory"}}]}
